  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "original-meta",
      "source": "WorkflowExportService.java:125-138",
      "fact": "原flowMeta仅name、description、avatarIcon、avatarColor、edgeType、category、advancedConfig，剔除null后加dslVersion=v1；不能直接导出WorkflowRecord或legacyView。"
    },
    {
      "id": "original-param-cleaning-inert",
      "source": "WorkflowExportService.java:108-120",
      "fact": "uid/appId/repoList/repoId/modelId/llmId/serviceId删除块为注释，原typed导出实际保留nodeParam内容；不能声称原包已去凭据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "typed-closed-surface",
      "source": "BizWorkflowData/BizWorkflowNode/BizWorkflowEdge/BizNodeData",
      "fact": "原typed flowData只有nodes/edges以及声明节点、连线、data字段；未声明根/节点/data扩展会被DTO裁剪。该旧行为不证明未知布局应删除，迁移设计366要求布局/引用/unknown保全。"
    },
    {
      "id": "typed-open-values",
      "source": "BizWorkflowNode.position/positionAbsolute/zIndex/draggable；BizNodeData.nodeMeta/nodeParam/retryConfig/errorOutputs；BizWorkflowEdge.data/markerEnd；BizSchema.default/item；BizValue.content",
      "fact": "这些Object/JSONObject声明允许合法业务嵌套内容；任意uid/userId/runId名称不足以判定平台账号或运行状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uid-exact-source",
      "source": "use-flow-common.ts:77-78,248-249,308-310；nodes/components/model-select/index.tsx:276；BaseLLMNode:1048,1089；node_debug.py:88",
      "fact": "真实node.data.nodeParam.uid由原user.uid写入并供模型请求/Span发起者使用；此精确path非空可按导出账号边界拒绝，不扩大到schema/default/HTTP业务uid。appId及model/llm/repo/service等保留为引用，不能由导出动作授予授权。"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary-exact-keys",
      "source": "RunJsonBoundary.java:17-31；WorkflowJsonBoundary.java:25-41",
      "fact": "唯一现有规则对password/passwd/secret/apikey/apisecret/token/accesstoken/refreshtoken/authorization/privatekey/clientsecret忽略大小写并去下划线/横线；非null且不等于空字符串则400。JSON字符串仅可解析为object/array时递归。不得新增宽泛敏感名称模式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary-preserves-or-rejects",
      "source": "WorkflowJsonBoundary.java:13-43；实际22case",
      "fact": "边界只检查不改输入；null/空凭据字段可保留，空格不等于空串；business input.name=token可保留，但business default对象token键或JSON示例prompt同名键会被现有规则拒绝。该误杀是已有保存边界，不应声称YAML新清理造成或再扩大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary-not-universal-detector",
      "source": "实际22case header-name-value/nonlisted-sensitive-name/managed-owner/internal-runtime",
      "fact": "现有规则不识别{name:Authorization,value:...}、apiToken以及owner/run/lease字段；有限key规则不能证明任意文本不存在秘密。根元数据7白名单和精确nodeParam.uid边界应独立于secret规则，禁止泛递归删除身份同名业务字段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "current-save-fresh-export",
      "source": "WorkflowService.java:88,108,201-204,327-332,372-386",
      "fact": "当前保存/版本已用WorkflowJsonBoundary，rawcanvas与扩展metadata独立存储；导出仍须对实际row候选包重核以防历史/直接导入脏row，而不是依旧保存成功推断安全。"
    },
    {
      "id": "no-runtime-or-identity-columns",
      "source": "WorkflowRecord.java；WorkflowService.java:59,346",
      "fact": "ownerUserId/spaceId/createBy/updateBy/latestVersion/revision及debugReceipt等是中心字段；七meta白名单不能夹带其legacyView。flowData真实业务同名字段需按已识别path审，不以名称递归剥除。"
    },
    {
      "id": "authorization-original-current",
      "source": "WorkflowController.java:450-473；WorkflowExportService.java:100-101",
      "fact": "原controller直接getById，导出service按SpaceInfoUtil/dataPermission可见性核查；新service应复用当前账号、空间成员、Workflow和真实Agent绑定规则，不移植无授权getById或调用原import/Core/Provider链。"
    },
    {
      "id": "yaml-not-execution",
      "source": "WorkflowExportService.java:140-152；完整迁移设计.md:366",
      "fact": "YAML业务包不等于assignment/execution资源快照，不纳入run/lease/checkpoint/privategrant。typed flowData投影不能借用CanvasExecutionCompiler而改变原画布array类型、handles、labels或节点参数。"
    }
  ],
